@startuml
title C4 Level 2 — core containers; ProjectForge remains an external system
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 180
actor "Private user / selected employer viewer" as U
rectangle "Resumefolio core system" {
 rectangle "Core web application\nIdentity / content / application / library contracts" as W
 rectangle "Bounded core processing\nPDF / safe file work; mechanism pending" as J
 database "Core-owned transactional records\nEngine/schema refinement pending" as D
 folder "Private files/media\nSAME Resumefolio server; outside public directories" as F
 W --> D : core-local guarded state
 J --> D : own bounded work
 W --> F : protected selected direct / range serving
 J --> F : safe core processing
}
rectangle "ProjectForge — separate software system\nNative Git Smart HTTP / Laravel\nSeparate MySQL 8.4 / same host, separate OS user" as P #DCF2E5
U --> W : current private or link-scoped context
W <--> P : authenticated user-scoped API
cloud "Independent recoverable backup destination\nActual setup / restore proof pending" as B
D --> B
F --> B
legend bottom
 C4 containers are applications/stores, not logical modules or a Docker selection.
 Future mail/calendar, advanced Sprint/Git and untrusted execution omitted from core containers.
endlegend
@enduml
